  "assembleHoodCabinet": "Use confirmat screws to join the top and bottom to the sides. Fix the shelves between the sides and the duct chase. Screw on its removable cover. The duct passes through two aligned holes. Check opening size, position, mounting points and installation height against your hood’s template. Fit cup hinges and secure the cabinet through its mounting rails.",
  "assembleSinkBase": "Join the bottom and top rails to the sides with confirmats. Screw the recessed plinth from the inside. The rails tie the open top beneath the worktop. The rear brace leaves the water and drain connections accessible.",
  "assemblePantryShelf": "Screw the shelves between the sides. Fasten the front retaining strips across the front edges of the sides. Anchor the tall, shallow unit to the wall.",
  "assembleDiningTable": "Bolt the crosspieces to the legs to make two trestles. Fasten each tabletop board from below to both trestles, keeping the gaps between boards.",
  "assembleSignatureCabinet": "Dowel and glue the stepped carcass, then glue on the face strips. The backs keep it square. Hang the door on hinges and use the round through-hole as a finger pull.",
  "assembleBookcase": "Screw the crosspieces to the uprights to build the two end frames. Fit the ledgers, then screw each shelf board to both supports. Anchor the top to the wall.",
  "assembleCoffeeTable": "Dowel and glue the aprons to the legs. Rest the lower shelf on the cleats between the rails. Secure the plywood top from below with corner brackets.",
  "assembleTvStand": "Join the carcass and dividers with confirmats. Fasten the back around its edges and to the dividers. Overlay doors cover the outer bays, with an open bay in the middle.",
  "assembleBedroomWardrobe": "Join the top, base and dividers with confirmats. Fit the rails in sockets and fasten the shelves and backs. Mount each door on its indicated hinge edge. Anchor the tall carcass to the wall.",
  "assemblePlatformBed": "Join the perimeter rails with knock-down bed fittings. Screw the ledgers to the inside faces. Support the centre beam on its own feet and attach it to the end rails. Secure the slats against sliding across the three supports.",
  "assembleDrawerChest": "Assemble the carcass with confirmats. Attach each drawer bottom and back to its sides, then screw on the front from inside. Fit paired runners level, allowing the clearance specified for the hardware. Anchor the carcass to the wall.",
  "assembleToyChest": "Glue the paired corner posts. Drive pocket screws from the inside ends of the wall boards and lower rails into the posts. Screw the floorboards to the lower rails and fasten the lid slats from underneath through the battens. Fit a piano hinge along the upper back board and a lid support rated to hold the lid in any position. Keep the ventilation gaps open.",
  "assembleCubeShelf": "Start with the continuous base. Assemble the stepped bays from the bottom up with dowels and panel connectors while the shelf ends are accessible. Anchor the unit to the wall.",
  "assembleStepStool": "Dowel and glue the plywood sides to the risers. Seat the treads on the supports and fasten with countersunk screws. Both side panels should bear along their full bottom edges.",
  "assembleShoeBench": "Build the plinth and set the base on it. Dowel and glue the sides and dividers between the seat and base. Fasten the back around its edges to keep the bench square.",
  "assembleConsoleTable": "Connect the sides to the top and base. Dowel the shelves into the dividers as each bay goes together. Provide wall anchoring for the narrow console.",
  "assembleMirrorFrame": "Dowel the crossbars into the posts. Assemble the stand-offs, cut their wall ends to the modelled angle and anchor the frame. Fit the mirror with separate glass clips.",
  "assembleBasinShelf": "Dowel and glue each front panel to its two wings with water-resistant glue, leaving the trap slot open at the back. Fix the shelves between the sides. Anchor the rails behind the wings to the wall and seal exposed plywood edges.",
  "assembleBlanketLadder": "Use two dowels at each end of every rung to prevent rotation. Secure the top to the wall. This ladder is a towel rack.",
  "assembleWritingDesk": "The desktop bears on an end panel and a shelving pedestal. Join the panels with confirmats, then secure the rear braces between the supports to resist sideways racking.",
  "assembleWallShelf": "Screw the projecting arms to the rear ledger. Anchor the ledger to a suitable wall structure, slide on the plywood shell and secure it to the frame from below.",
  "assembleFileTrays": "Glue each pair of cleats level on the sides. Set a plywood tray on each pair and fasten the back panel to keep the sides parallel.",
  "assembleWorkbench": "Glue the laminated legs and each slab separately. Bolt the base rails to the legs. Fasten the slabs from below, maintaining the central gap and allowing seasonal movement across the grain.",
  "assembleSawhorse": "Cut the splayed legs to the modelled end angles for full contact with the floor and cap. Bolt the aprons to the legs and fasten the lower ties.",
  "assembleMachineStand": "Build both end frames and bolt them together with the long rails. Screw the plywood decks down onto the rails. The three-piece lower shelf fits around the legs.",
  "assembleRaisedBed": "Screw the wall boards to the corner and centre posts from outside with exterior screws. Tie the centre posts together across the bed. Mitre both ends of all four cap boards at 45° and screw them down to the posts.",
  "assembleBench": "Join the long and short aprons to the legs with glued dowels or pocket screws from inside. Space the seat slats evenly and screw them down to the rails.",
  "assemblePicnicTable": "Build the two A-frames first. Through-bolt the splayed legs to the crosspieces with washers. Screw the tabletop and seat boards down onto the supports, then fit the longitudinal tie.",
  "assembleChaise": "Build the two side frames. Bolt the fixed backrest at its designed angle against the cut supports. Screw the seat and back slats to both sides, leaving drainage gaps.",
  "assemblePottingBench": "Screw the rails to the posts using exterior fasteners. Fix the worktop boards to the crosspieces, keeping the insert opening clear. The tall rear posts carry the upper shelf.",
  "assembleLogStore": "Tie the posts together with the long rails and fix the floor slats to the crosspieces. Cut the post tops to the roof slope. Space the wall slats to ventilate the firewood.",
  "assembleGardenGate": "Fasten the pickets to the two rails. Cut the diagonal brace to bear at both ends, from the upper latch corner down to the lower hinge. Fix the hinges into the rails.",
  "assembleBirdhouse": "Bring the mitred roof edges together at the ridge. Drill pilot holes and fasten the end panels and base to the roof boards. Make one end removable for cleaning.",
  "assemblePorch": "Assemble the step and landing frames and screw the decking to the crosspieces. Bolt the guard posts to the frame. Cut the handrail to the slope and fix it to the posts. Select anchorage for the installation site."
}
